=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>We know,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p>"
